The inaugural Al Ain Dates Festival (Rutab), organised by 
@torathEHC
 at Al Sarooj Park in Al Ain Region, features 19 competitions that enable farmers and productive families to showcase their finest rutab, fruit and handicrafts, with 245 prizes worth over AED5 million.

